            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Ben There, Dan That!</i> and <i>Time Gentlemen, Please!</i> are a couple of rip-roaring point-and-click adventure games . With tongue firmly in cheek, sit back, relax, and put your mind to work solving puzzles, and reading some very funny dialogue. It's like a book, only good!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>From an horrific and untimely death in deep, dark Peru, via preposterous-and-suspect alien invasions, to whipping back-and-forth in time to stop Hitler and his army of robot Nazi dinosaur clones, this is one set of adventures you're unlikely to forget.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Key features:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Funny words that'll actually probably make you laugh out loud!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Graphics AND sound effects!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Thousands of unique responses for almost every action you can think of!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>NAZI  DINOSAURS!\n\t\t\t\t\t",
            "about_the_game": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Ben There, Dan That!</i> and <i>Time Gentlemen, Please!</i> are a couple of rip-roaring point-and-click adventure games . With tongue firmly in cheek, sit back, relax, and put your mind to work solving puzzles, and reading some very funny dialogue. It's like a book, only good!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>From an horrific and untimely death in deep, dark Peru, via preposterous-and-suspect alien invasions, to whipping back-and-forth in time to stop Hitler and his army of robot Nazi dinosaur clones, this is one set of adventures you're unlikely to forget.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Key features:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Funny words that'll actually probably make you laugh out loud!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Graphics AND sound effects!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Thousands of unique responses for almost every action you can think of!\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>NAZI  DINOSAURS!\n\t\t\t\t\t",
            "short_description": "Ben There, Dan That! and Time Gentlemen, Please! are a couple of rip-roaring point-and-click adventure games . With tongue firmly in cheek, sit back, relax, and put your mind to work solving puzzles, and reading some very funny dialogue. It's like a book, only good!",
